  "text": "Step back and the big picture is remarkably clean. MCP takes AI out of an isolated chat box and turns it into an interoperable partner—collapsing an unmanageable web of custom integrations into one open standard built on hosts, clients, servers, tools, resources, and prompts. Instead of copy-pasting your work to AI, your AI meets you where your work already lives.",
